{"vid":"u4KeAjLnOo0","source":"u4KeAjLnOo0.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.4,"txt":"For almost 100 years, AWS has proudly"},{"t":4.2,"txt":"supported welding and its many visionary"},{"t":6.8,"txt":"leaders who drove us forward. Their push"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"for higher standards, continued"},{"t":11.9,"txt":"learning, and new technology made the"},{"t":14.6,"txt":"impossible possible. Today, AWS stands"},{"t":19,"txt":"stronger than ever with a singular"},{"t":21.2,"txt":"mission powering our future."},{"t":24.7,"txt":"Inspiring members with better results"},{"t":27.4,"txt":"and bigger opportunities."},{"t":29.8,"txt":"Building stronger standards that keep us"},{"t":32.1,"txt":"safer, motivating new generations to"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"join us, igniting important"},{"t":38.1,"txt":"conversations about today's issues and"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"tomorrow's possibilities,"},{"t":42.8,"txt":"and most importantly, engaging welding"},{"t":45.6,"txt":"communities from every corner of the"},{"t":47.4,"txt":"globe to collaborate and share"},{"t":49.8,"txt":"knowledge. Across every continent and"},{"t":52.8,"txt":"culture lie extraordinary achievements,"},{"t":55.6,"txt":"all made possible by the art and science"},{"t":58.5,"txt":"of welding. Our ability to conquer new"},{"t":61.7,"txt":"challenges to provide educational"},{"t":64,"txt":"opportunities that help people better"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"themselves and their families. That's"},{"t":69.3,"txt":"what strengthens the future of welding"},{"t":71.8,"txt":"and our world forward."}],"words":[{"t":0.4,"w":"For"},{"t":0.719,"w":"almost"},{"t":1.28,"w":"100"},{"t":2,"w":"years,"},{"t":2.56,"w":"AWS"},{"t":3.52,"w":"has"},{"t":3.76,"w":"proudly"},{"t":4.24,"w":"supported"},{"t":4.72,"w":"welding"},{"t":5.359,"w":"and"},{"t":5.6,"w":"its"},{"t":5.839,"w":"many"},{"t":6.16,"w":"visionary"},{"t":6.799,"w":"leaders"},{"t":7.279,"w":"who"},{"t":7.6,"w":"drove"},{"t":7.919,"w":"us"},{"t":8.24,"w":"forward."},{"t":9.2,"w":"Their"},{"t":